# Intercepted initial and repair responses; no real inference or source execution.
name: Rejected context output remains inspectable and unaccepted after restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/rejected_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/context-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 planned | approved-context-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | single-context-started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/rejected_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | rejected-context-job
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 rejected-context-output.txt | safe-failure-card
expect-not: LABELED_REJECTED_OUTPUT
expect: d output
ask: Does the failed job preserve spending and name locally retained diagnosis without leaking model text or suggesting accepted context?
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 REJECTED CONTEXT OUTPUT | explicit-local-inspection
expect: UNACCEPTED MODEL OUTPUT
ask: Does explicit inspection label untrusted model output, record source/model/run provenance and keep acceptance separate?
keys: Enter m n s t Tab
require-live-snap: 15 REJECTED CONTEXT OUTPUT | inert-inspection
expect-not: REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE
resize: 160x48
live-snap: diagnostic-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: diagnostic-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: diagnostic-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: diagnostic-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: diagnostic-40x12
expect: d / Esc back · PgUp/Dn read
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 This output is unaccepted. | complete-diagnostic-tail
ask: At 40x12, can the operator read the complete bounded diagnosis, see the reading position and return without accepting or running anything?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | failure-origin-restored
expect-not: LABELED_REJECTED_OUTPUT
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 15 CAMPAIGN rejected-context | recorded-jobs
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/context-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | saved-rejected-job
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 d output | recovered-failure-card
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 REJECTED CONTEXT OUTPUT | diagnosis-after-restart
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/rejected_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: After actual restart without color, is the same rejected diagnostic readable with unchanged source and two recorded requests, while context remains unaccepted?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | recovered-origin
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 15 CAMPAIGN rejected-context | exit-origin
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/rejected_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART damage
keys: a
require-live-snap: 15 Retained diagnostic unavailable | corrupted-input-disclosed
expect-not: LABELED_REJECTED_OUTPUT
keys: d
require-live-snap: 15 Rejected output unavailable | corrupted-input-refused
expect-not: LABELED_REJECTED_OUTPUT
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/rejected_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does changed diagnostic input produce a readable unavailable state without exposing unauthenticated output, accepting context or spending more requests?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | corrupted-origin
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 15 CAMPAIGN rejected-context | final-exit-origin
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
